{"id":"unbedingt","lemma":"unbedingt","pos":"adv","rank":700,"glosses":["absolutely, definitely","unconditionally"],"ipa":"/ˈʊnbəˌdɪŋt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/ce/De-unbedingt.ogg/De-unbedingt.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Du solltest unbedingt dieses Buch lesen.","en":"You should definitely read this book.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},null,{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"book (collection of…"},{"g":"to read"}]},{"text":"Wir müssen unbedingt gewinnen.","en":"We really need to win.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755934","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have to"},null,{"g":"to win"}]},{"text":"Ich brauche unbedingt ein Auto.","en":"I desperately need a car.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"car"}]},{"text":"Ich will ihn unbedingt sehen.","en":"I want to see him very much.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"him"},null,{"g":"to see"}]},{"text":"Musst du das unbedingt jetzt machen?","en":"Do you have to be doing that now?","words":[{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"now"},{"g":"to make"}]}]}